--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3b101ddc51b680541b32164e5d3bfef1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_AfterStage1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  location: THE CLEARING
  background: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - speakerId: ROOK
    emotion: 0
    text: Found something. A collar. It's cracked open.
    side: 0
    radio: 0
  - speakerId: PIP
    emotion: 3
    text: Scan it! Hold it up... oh no. That's a neural control chip. Rook, those
      lions weren't aggressive. They were being driven.
    side: 0
    radio: 1
  - speakerId: ROOK
    emotion: 5
    text: They didn't know what they were doing.
    side: 0
    radio: 0
  - speakerId: PIP
    emotion: 5
    text: No. They were scared the whole time.
    side: 0
    radio: 1
  - speakerId: ROOK
    emotion: 1
    text: Then whoever did this is going to have a very bad day.
    side: 0
    radio: 0
  - speakerId: PIP
    emotion: 3
    text: There's a name tag on the collar. 'Reserve Ranger Unit 3, T. Reyes.' Somebody
      raised this one.
    side: 0
    radio: 1
  - speakerId: ROOK
    emotion: 0
    text: Where is she?
    side: 0
    radio: 0
  - speakerId: PIP
    emotion: 0
    text: My guess? Wherever the lions came from. There's a base east of you.
    side: 0
    radio: 1
  - speakerId: ROOK
    emotion: 0
    text: Not a cat person. But I'm going.
    side: 0
    radio: 0
  nextSceneName: 
